<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Official Document - <%= profile.full_name %></title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #e2e8f0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 2rem; }
    
    .page { width: 100%; max-width: 800px; background: #fff; padding: 4rem; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: relative; }
    .page::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; border: 2px solid #0a1e32; pointer-events: none; }
    
    .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .header h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; color: #0a1e32; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .header h2 { font-size: 1rem; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    
    .title { text-align: center; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: #1e4d7b; margin: 3rem 0; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #f5a623; text-underline-offset: 8px; }
    
    .content { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .content strong { color: #0a1e32; }
    
    .courses-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 2rem 0; }
    .courses-table th { background: #f8fafc; padding: 1rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0a1e32; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .courses-table td { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    
    .footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 5rem; }
    .signature { text-align: center; }
    .signature-line { width: 200px; border-bottom: 2px solid #0a1e32; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .signature p { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0a1e32; }
    .seal { width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px dashed #f5a623; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #f5a623; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center; transform: rotate(-15deg); }
    
    .print-btn { position: fixed; top: 2rem; right: 2rem; background: #0a1e32; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2rem; border: none; border-radius: 100px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .print-btn:hover { background: #1e4d7b; }
    
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
      .page { box-shadow: none; padding: 2rem; }
      .print-btn { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <button class="print-btn" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Print / Save as PDF</button>

  <div class="page">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>LuxMind University</h1>
      <h2>Office of the Registrar</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="title"><%= document.document_type %></div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>This is to certify that <strong><%= profile.full_name %></strong>, bearing Student ID <strong><%= profile.admission_number || profile.username %></strong>, is a registered student at LuxMind University.</p>
      
      <p>He/She is currently enrolled in the <strong><%= profile.class_level %></strong> program and is in <strong>Semester <%= profile.current_semester %></strong> for the current academic year.</p>
      
      <% if (document.document_type === 'Enrollment Certificate' || document.document_type === 'Official Transcript') { %>
        <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">The following courses are officially registered and active in the student's academic record:</p>
        <table class="courses-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Course Code</th>
              <th>Course Title</th>
              <th>Credits</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% if (courses.length === 0) { %>
              <tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; font-style: italic;">No active enrollments found.</td></tr>
            <% } %>
            <% courses.forEach(c => { %>
              <tr>
                <td><strong><%= c.code %></strong></td>
                <td><%= c.title %></td>
                <td><%= c.credits %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <% } %>
      
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">This document is issued upon the request of the student for whatever legal purpose it may serve.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">Date Issued: <%= today %></p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Document Reference: DOC-<%= document.id %>-<%= profile.admission_number %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="signature">
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <p>University Registrar</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seal">
        LUXMIND<br>OFFICIAL
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>